# REAL FIRM DATA IS NEVER TRACKED (ruling 2026-11-10). Every path below is listed in
# scripts/fixtures/real-data-manifest.json, is local-only, and has a committed synthetic stand-in at
# fixtures/synthetic/<same path> that scripts/ensure-local-data.ts (postinstall + vitest globalSetup)
# copies into place only when the real file is absent. scripts/prepush-confidential-scan.mjs blocks a
# push that adds or modifies any of them; scripts/governance-check.ts fails if one is tracked.
# data/snapshots/portfolio.json is covered by the data/snapshots/*.json rule above.
